 optimistic; \"\n        \"rules were selected after inspecting the same folds.\"\n    ),\n    \"next_steps\": [\n        \"Recover original temporal and spatial feature-generation code.\",\n        \"Generate validation/private features from released histories only.\",\n        \"Check feature alignment and row order.\",\n        \"Fit final models and create official-format submission files.\",\n    ],\n    \"copied_files\": copied,\n    \"missing_files\": missing,\n}\n\n(CHECKPOINT / \"progress_checkpoint.json\").write_text(\n    json.dumps(checkpoint, indent=2)\n)\n\nnotes = f\"\"\"# Traffic Flow Bench — Resume Checkpoint\n\nSaved: {checkpoint['created_at']}\n\n## Completed\n- Processed all eight panels' training features.\n- Established a common 42-feature schema.\n- Trained condition-specific LightGBM models in the current session.\n- Verified OOF labels and keys: 55,362 rows, no duplicate keys,\n  zero label disagreements after repairing missing panel IDs.\n- Baseline exploratory mean IoU: 0.4385.\n- Panel-specific hybrid exploratory mean IoU: 0.5944, but optimistic.\n\n## Model configuration\n- LightGBM, separate queue_onset and queue_ongoing models\n- 300 estimators, learning rate 0.03, 15 leaves\n- min_child_samples=30, reg_lambda=2.0\n- Threshold=0.50\n\n## Next task\nGenerate validation and private spatial features using the original\nfeature-generation logic. Do not use submission placeholders as labels.\nPreserve the exact 42-feature schema and official submission row order.\n\n## Important\nKaggle /working files can disappear when the session is reset.\nDownload or otherwise export the checkpoint folder before closing.\nThis checkpoint stores results and configuration, not fitted model objects.\n\"\"\"\n(CHECKPOINT / \"RESUME_NOTES.md\").write_text(notes)\n\nprint(\"Checkpoint saved to:\", CHECKPOINT)\nprint(\"Files copied:\", len(copied))\nprint(\"Files not found:\", missing)\nprint(\"Feature count:\", len(features))\nprint(\"Checkpoint contents:\")\